.TH CHTTPSVR_CONSTRUCT 3 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Macros"
.SH NAME
chttpsvr_construct \- declare and initialize a chttpsvr handle
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <ccollections/chttpserver.h>

chttpsvr_construct(name, cl);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Declares a chttpsvr variable called name and assigns it the result of
ccol_create_chttpsvr(cl).  On failure it calls ccol_fatal_err() and
does not return.
.fi
.SH PARAMETERS
.nf
name     The identifier for the new handle variable.
cl       The parent logger from which the logger of this server is
         derived.  Pass CLOG_INVALID to use an internal logger that
         writes only FATAL messages to stderr; see
         ccol_create_chttpsvr_mp for details.
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR chttpsvr_construct_scoped (3),
.BR chttpsvr_declare (3),
.BR ccol_create_chttpsvr (3)
